  "noise": {
    "about": "Velocity spectrum of captured dances: per 1 s window, rms of the bone's angular (center: linear) velocity in each band = rest + per_speed * speed of the bone in the window (degrees or units per second; the speed taken in [min_speed, max_speed]: 5% and 95% of the donors' speeds). Noise fills only what the motion lacks in a band; axes: share of each local axis. The rest level of the bands from 1 Hz is set to 0: in the donors it is mostly capture noise, which makes a still pose tremble. The center has no rest level at all: its slow donor motion is mostly the up and down of the dance, which makes a still pose squat",
